# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 11, discretionary wording fix] An indented
# `#` comment inside a `config` body. Spec-conformant to refuse (a `#`
# anywhere but column 1 is data), but the diagnostic used to read "'#' is
# not a config-block directive" -- confusing in the one region where
# indentation is structural. Named here so the improved wording is
# exercised, not merely described.
config dev
  # the CI build
  flags i

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
